  "prefLabel": "Par 303.02 Eligibility for Medical Parole",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-09-06",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Par 303.02 Eligibility for Medical Parole. The board shall consider for medical parole any prisoner who meets the criteria set forth in RSA 651-A:10-a, I (a) , (b) and (c). A medical parole hearing shall be convened once the board receives a formal request for such from the commissioner of the department of corrections.\n\nSource. #9255, eff 9-6-08, EXPIRED: 9-6-16\n\nNew. #12158, eff 4-7-17",
